=== GALACTIC PILOT GUIDE: BASICS & ENERGY ===

Void Trader is an interstellar strategy & trading simulation.
As an independent merchant commander, your goal is to amass wealth,
upgrade your vessel, and climb the galactic leaderboards.

* TURNS: You are allocated a max of 100 turns per day.
  Turns automatically refresh to 100 every day at midnight (00:00 UTC).
* FUEL: Warping between adjacent sectors consumes 3 Fuel units.
* ENERGY CONVERSION: Fuel Ore can be converted to Fuel at 10:1 ratio.
* STARDOCK ALPHA: Sector (15,8,3) hosts the central federation hub
  with full shipyard, banking vault, insurance, and armory services.
